.Dd September 22, 2026
.Dt ADDUSER 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm adduser
.Nd add a user interactively
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl S
.Op Ar username
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
asks for a user name, full name, uid, shell, whether the user is an
administrator
.Pq a member of Dq admin , who may use Xr sudo 8
and a password, shows the summary, and on confirmation creates the user
with
.Xr dscli 8 :
a record in
.Pa /Local/Library/DirectoryServices/Users.plist ,
a private group, and a home under
.Pa /Local/Users
seeded from
.Pa /usr/share/skel .
The default shell is
.Pa /bin/zsh .
An empty password lets the user log in without one.
.Pp
Every user
.Nm
creates is a directory user.
System accounts are created with
.Xr pw 8 .
.Pp
.Fl S
skips the introductory and closing lines.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr passwd 1 ,
.Xr dscli 8 ,
.Xr pw 8 ,
.Xr rmuser 8
